"Executioners sentence wizards to years of productive labor for Artonans and Triplanet worlds."
"Years are summed per harm: e.g. thrice the service a crime meant to extract, plus a victim's risk."
"Betraying the agreement to protect a Here-to-There adds nine years."
"A sentence may exceed a natural life and still count as gentle, as mercy for not demanding verification."
"The executioner reviews the convict's proficiencies for placement and chances to reduce the sentence."
